        ('**B.** → True\n\nAt $t=0$ the table records the initial level, and at $t=1$ the continuous formula supplies the one-step growth.\n\n$$P(0)=P_0$$\n\n$$P(1)=P_0 e^{k}$$\n\nDivide and take the natural log.\n\n$$\\frac{P(1)}{P(0)}=e^{k}$$\n\n$$k=\\ln\\frac{P(1)}{P(0)}$$\n\nThat is exactly the continuous force recovered from the first unit window.\n\nSo the statement is True.'),
